      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "[This wiki page](https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/wiki/Submitting-Bugs-and-Suggestions) contains good guidance but I have the feeling some folk find the Report Issue option on VSCode's Help menu without also finding that wiki page.\r\n\r\nI suggest the Issue Reporter dialog gets a link added to it.\r\n",
